headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Vela Commerce API collection

  Collection-level settings. The `Accept` header is set once here rather than on every
  request, so a request added later cannot forget it and start negotiating for HTML.

  The cart requests depend on a session cookie that the API issues on the first response
  of the run. Nothing here manages that cookie: Bruno's own cookie jar does, and the
  Cart folder asserts that it worked instead of assuming it.
}
